      "message": "ANX7688 update VBUS present status(TCPC_REG_POWER_STATUS) by ADC sampling, also it will take about 2~3ms to caculate current voltage value to calibrate the sampling data by TCPC FW. Yet by hardware voltage comparator methods( checking 0x50:40), it can be almost realtime to get the vbus-present status(Voltage \u003e 3.7V).",
